request.description:
Jenis dokumen selain `ktp`/`npwp`.

Contoh response (422 Jenis dokumen selain ktp/npwp):

```json
{
  "detail": [
    {
      "type": "literal_error",
      "loc": [
        "path",
        "doc_type"
      ],
      "msg": "Input should be 'ktp' or 'npwp'",
      "input": "sim",
      "ctx": {
        "expected": "'ktp' or 'npwp'"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Nomor tiket harus sesuai pola `[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}`.

Contoh response (422 Nomor tiket tidak sesuai pola):

```json
{
  "detail": [
    {
      "type": "string_pattern_mismatch",
      "loc": [
        "path",
        "ticket_id"
      ],
      "msg": "String should match pattern '^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$'",
      "input": "tiket!",
      "ctx": {
        "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
